            "html": "<article id=\"post-40768\" class=\"post-40768 post type-post status-publish format-aside hentry post_format-post-format-aside category-direcao-de-arte-ia category-links tag-ditaura tag-simpsons tag-stf\"><header class=\"entry-header\"><div class=\"entry-meta\"><span class=\"cat-links\"><a href=\"cat.html#direcao-de-arte-ia\" rel=\"category\">Direção de Arte/IA</a>, <a href=\"cat.html#links\" rel=\"category\">Links</a></span></div><h1 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"2026-09-06-obedeca-as-regras-ja-pode-protestar.html\" rel=\"bookmark\">Obedeça Às Regras: Já Pode Protestar</a></h1><div class=\"entry-meta\"><span class=\"post-format\"><a class=\"entry-format\" href=\"type.html#aside\">Nota</a></span> <span class=\"entry-date\"><a href=\"2026-09-06-obedeca-as-regras-ja-pode-protestar.html\" rel=\"bookmark\"><time class=\"entry-date\" datetime=\"2026-09-06T02:45:33-03:00\">06/09/2026</time></a></span> <span class=\"byline\"><span class=\"author vcard\"><a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/\" rel=\"author\">estranhosidade</a></span></span> <span class=\"comments-link\"><a href=\"2026-09-06-obedeca-as-regras-ja-pode-protestar.html#respond\">Deixe um comentário</a></span></div><div class=\"entry-meta tag-links-top\"><span class=\"tag-links\"><a href=\"tag.html#ditaura\" rel=\"tag\">Ditaura</a> <a href=\"tag.html#simpsons\" rel=\"tag\">Simpsons</a> <a href=\"tag.html#stf\" rel=\"tag\">STF</a> </span><span class=\"tag-ellipsis\" style=\"display: none;\">...</span></div></header><!-- .entry-header --><div class=\"entry-content\"><figure style=\"width: 500px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><a href=\"https://archive.org/download/blogfilesx/IMG-05-09-2026=1788612451.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://archive.org/download/blogfilesx/IMG-05-09-2026=1788612451-thumbview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"374\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Referência: <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20201025032144/https://simpsons.fandom.com/wiki/Canadian_Graffiti\">The Simpsons – The Bart Wants What it Wants</a></figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote>\n<h1><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20260905124033/https://veja.abril.com.br/cultura/a-cobranca-de-dinho-ouro-preto-contra-stf-e-vorcaro-no-rock-in-rio/\">VEJA | A cobrança de Dinho Ouro Preto contra STF e Vorcaro no Rock in Rio</a></h1>\n<p>Tem que ser muito corajoso para criticar o STF em 2026, depois que a extrema imprensa e o establishment passaram criticar ele e seus comparsas. Mais corajoso ainda para criticar o Moraes apenas pelo leque de ações delituosas que a mídia decidiu responsabilizá-los – <a href=\"2026-01-01-ainda-nao.html\">e não pelo julgamento farsesco que eles deram aos coitados do dia 8</a>.</p></blockquote>\n</div></article>",
